{"title":"CHAMPAGNE","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis collection is a celebration of sophistication and style. Crafted to represent the epitome of refinement, these bottles are perfect for those who appreciate exceptional quality and design. Elevate your champagne experience with Datum Dahleez’s signature touch, and savour every moment of celebration in true Datum Dahleez fashion.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-champagne-carbon-eb01","title":"Datum Dahleez CHAMPAGNE CARBON EB01","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe EB01 champagne is a vintage 2002 champagne created from 90% Chardonnay and 10% Pinot Noir. Blossoming floral aromas in the glass and everlasting smoothness and roundness on your pallet. A full-bodied vintage with crispy essences waltzes with lace-like bubbles in infinite whirls. The champagne unfolds a horizon of delightful green fruits and nuts, amplified by a jolting note of salty-minerality. The 750ml bottle is wrapped with Carbon Fiber. Packaging includes luxury box and free delivery all over Europe.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344147226971,"sku":"EB01","price":320.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/c13_1_cc859739-9b84-4cf5-bcd1-3dcbb2072ad3.jpg?v=1742416347"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-champagne-carbon-eb02","title":"Datum Dahleez CHAMPAGNE CARBON EB02","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe EB02 cuvée is a vintage blanc de blancs 2006 boasts robe and fine bubbles, before opening-up to a large aromatic pallet with acacia notes, hazelnuts and stone fruits. The grape variety is 100% Chardonnay Grand Cru, which can be tasted both for aperitive, during a gastronomic meal or a happy moment of life, with raw ham of Pata Negra or a delicious caviar, this cuvée pairs well with all occasions. The 750ml bottle is wrapped with Carbon Fiber. Packaging includes luxury box and free delivery all over Europe.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344149160283,"sku":"EB02","price":320.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/c5_ee7fb0ca-d3d4-4a2a-8bfe-f6fe0a1ae029.jpg?v=1742416346"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-champagne-carbon-eb03","title":"Datum Dahleez CHAMPAGNE CARBON EB03","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe EB03 cuvée is a 2013 vintage, which has initial scents of citrus, followed by aromas of spring flowers, then a growing intensity toward yellow citrus, toasty notes and aromatic herbs. On the palate it provides an initial intensity, followed by a creamier more velvety texture. The finish reveals hints of acidity. The grape variety is 100% Chardonnay Grand Cru, which will enhance a delicate recipe such as a scallop ceviche, a red tuna sashimi or a filet of Saint-Pierre with citrus fruits. The 750ml bottle is wrapped with Carbon Fiber. Packaging includes luxury box and free delivery all over Europe.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344151814491,"sku":"EB03","price":320.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/c9_786d28de-c6c0-48cd-9b82-be1dbbf2e496.jpg?v=1742416345"}],"url":"https:\/\/Datum Dahleez.store\/collections\/champagne.oembed","provider":"Datum Dahleez STORE","version":"1.0","type":"link"}